  "goodToKnow": "Die Manier means manner or style: in bester Manier, nach Gutsherrenart (in a lordly manner), in der Manier eines Profis. In the plural, Manieren are manners: gute Manieren, keine Manieren haben, Tischmanieren. Germany's best-known etiquette guide is Freiherr Knigge's 1788 book, so der Knigge means an etiquette guide. Manieriert means affected. Stressed on the last syllable: ma-NEER."
